.TH std::mersenne_twister_engine::operator() 3 "2026.11.10" "http://cppreference.com" "C++ Standard Libary"
.SH NAME
std::mersenne_twister_engine::operator() \- std::mersenne_twister_engine::operator()

.SH Synopsis
result_type operator()();  \fI(since C++11)\fP

Advances the state of the engine, and generates a pseudo-random value from the new state.

.SH Return value

A pseudo-random number in [min(), max()].

.SH Complexity

Amortized constant.

.SH See also

discard advances the engine's state by a specified amount
        \fI(public member function)\fP
